<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST - Hungary T-bill, bond yields seen dropping.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Hungary T-bill, bond yields seen dropping.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields on Hungary's one- and three-month discount Treasury bills and two-year government bonds are likely to continue a declining trend at this week's auctions, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency will auction one-month discount Treasury bills on Tuesday, three-month bills on Wednesday and 1998/K two-year bonds on Thursday.</p>
